window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>From #1 bestseller Morgan Rice comes the second book in a spectacular new fantasy series, THORNHAVEN, ideal for fans of Brandon Sanderson, Rebecca Yarros, and Sarah J. Maas.</b></p> <p>As a fourth-year student at Thornhaven, Faye Wilderpath steps into a leadership role, commanding teams on high-stakes missions. She struggles with the weight of responsibility and the harsh realities of sacrifice in battle. Her romantic entanglements with Callum and Ren reach a boiling point, forcing her to confront her feelings amidst the chaos of war, even while a major Netherkin offensive threatens to overwhelm Thornhaven. Faye must rally her fellow students to defend their home—or risk losing everything to an enemy more terrifying than she ever imagined.<br> <br> Enter a romantasy world like nothing you’ve seen before, with an exhilarating realm filled with peril and promise. Destiny guides Faye to experiences of romance and magic while challenging her determination to endure in a saga characterized by unexpected twists and gripping excitement. It will captivate both young minds and experienced fantasy enthusiasts alike, as you fall in love and don't stop listening.<br> <br> Future books in the series are available!</p>"; 
